2019Afrique \ud83c\udf0d est une arnaque g\u00e9ante :", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 15421}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVQwwFk8", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 23, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "takeit", "id": 8858728, "raw_content": "So it happened to me today. My whole crew is sick with the chy-nuh virus, even the doggo somehow, and I have the brain frog. Even so my ambitions are not disturbed and I needed gun parts and ammo for a new build I'm working on, so off to my local shop I went. But it was there in the parking lot that reality suddenly appeared - I was completely unarmed. I didn't have my .380 pocket pistol, my big mm (10) or any of the half dozen or so 9mm handguns that I own and that was very unusual. I usually carry between one and two pistols with me everywhere I go. I felt so naked and miles away from home- like that dream where you show up to school in your underwear. But surprisingly I did have my pepper spray in my pocket, which is something. It's a good tool to have in case some liberal douche nozzle wants to get fresh about my \"It's not okay to be gay\" shirt or some future astronaut starts chimping out over a casual social misunderstanding, but not against an armed assailant. \n\nTL;DR - If you know how many guns you have you probably don't have enough. Brain frog is a helluva drug. And most importantly, ***stay strapped Frens.***\n\n-Kek", "author": "kek-is-tan", "created": 1790531757437, "profile_picture": "I8XXB1DBtIOB", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "bratt", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Happy Sunday don't forget your gun at home day", "last_comment_created": 1790536804747, "content": "<p>So it happened to me today. My whole crew is sick with the chy-nuh virus, even the doggo somehow, and I have the brain frog. Even so my ambitions are not disturbed and I needed gun parts and ammo for a new build I'm working on, so off to my local shop I went. But it was there in the parking lot that reality suddenly appeared - I was completely unarmed. I didn't have my .380 pocket pistol, my big mm (10) or any of the half dozen or so 9mm handguns that I own and that was very unusual. I usually carry between one and two pistols with me everywhere I go. I felt so naked and miles away from home- like that dream where you show up to school in your underwear. But surprisingly I did have my pepper spray in my pocket, which is something. It's a good tool to have in case some liberal douche nozzle wants to get fresh about my &quot;It's not okay to be gay&quot; shirt or some future astronaut starts chimping out over a casual social misunderstanding, but not against an armed assailant.</p>\n<p>TL;DR - If you know how many guns you have you probably don't have enough. Brain frog is a helluva drug. And most importantly, <em><strong>stay strapped Frens.</strong></em></p>\n<p>-Kek</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 6, "score_up": 23, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "COME AND TAKE IT", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVQwwFo8", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 23, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "pence", "id": 8858730, "raw_content": "", "author": "CleanUpPhillyTrump24", "created": 1790531774965, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comme